EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}This should go up against the wall,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and I'll put that opposite it{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Wait a sec!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Am I gonna be able to
get out if I do that?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Esto tendría que ir contra la pared,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
y esto tendría que ir enfrente{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡Un momento!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Si hago eso,
¿luego podré salir?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Questo dovrebbe andare sul muro{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
e di fronte ci metterò questo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ma, aspetta un secondo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Se faccio così, forse non riesco
più a uscire di casa...!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Sanırım{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} feng shui açısından,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
