zaman kapıyı açamam.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Zor karar.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ay,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡pero bueno!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0027:}}Yo solo{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
intento encontrar la forma
